Document the engine-selection rule (OrcaSlicer for Bambu Lab printers, CuraEngine for everything else) and the ``orient`` / ``rotate`` semantics across the README, ``CLAUDE.md``, ``docs/ai-setup-prompt.md``, ``docs/config.md``, and ``docs/llm.md``. Also fix broken ``estampo/estampo/action@v1`` references to ``@v0`` — ``v1`` is never created by the release pipeline (``release.yml`` derives ``v${MAJOR}`` from the package version, which is pre-1.0).
